  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Soul path Gu worms existed since the immemorial era, yet the novel treats the path itself as a later creation rather than as an ancient discipline that was always named.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Secluded domains such as Dang Hun Mountain and Luo Po Valley are filled with soul path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        986
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_dang_hun_mountain",
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Soul path Gu Immortals carry soul path dao marks that let the body hold an even stronger soul.",
      "chapters": [
        997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Spectral Soul Demon Venerable is the creator of soul path and the figure who singlehandedly pushed it to its peak. During his era, out of ten Gu Masters, at least five chose soul path. To obtain souls for soul path Gu worms he engaged in massacre, and the novel names him the venerable with the most murderous nature. Because many cultivators needed souls as resources, killing and open soul trade filled that era.",
      "chapters": [
        996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-soul-creates-and-peaks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Countless soul path experts then innovated large numbers of soul path methods, so that even after later suppression, precious methods still pass down generation to generation.",
      "chapters": [
        997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-soul-creates-and-peaks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Spectral Soul died, Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable appeared. One major accomplishment of his Immortal Venerable career was to suppress soul path. Soul path Gu Masters decreased in numbers, and trade involving souls was forced underground. Even in treasure yellow heaven, sale of souls remains rare in the stretch that recounts this history.",
      "chapters": [
        996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paradise-earth-suppresses",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    }
